<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for contacting us.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If lost/stolen item use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I was very concerned to hear about your missing -<b><i>ITEM</i></b>- on board QF{!Case.Flight_Number__c} on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}. As soon as you reported the item as missing to us, we carried out a thorough search, but I’m afraid we haven’t found any trace of your <b><i>-ITEM-</i></b>.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If damaged item use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I was concerned to hear about the damage to your (item) while you were on board QF{!Case.Flight_Number__c} on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">While we take all possible care to help you look after any belongings you carry on your flights or through our airports, they do remain each customers’ own responsibility.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If requesting compensation add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We are unable to meet your request for compensation, as the <b><i>-ITEM-</i></b> was in your own care. We can send you any additional information you need to complete a travel insurance claim. Please let us know if you need a letter outlining what happened.&nbsp;</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We hope that things go more smoothly for you next time you travel and look forward to welcoming you on board Qantas again in the future.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: white;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>